ft(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}=4\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{4})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 4=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186678633 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "18c0ccdc-170c-54ad-a845-5dc98b396090" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678611} {:answer/id #uuid "30c69d46-ccea-5283-825f-948729033a54" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678629} {:answer/id #uuid "4fb81696-331e-59ed-86c1-f465803f114c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678652} {:answer/id #uuid "ca5b2f59-a145-587b-a4c1-a9609a57f58b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678721} {:answer/id #uuid "e9506a52-47ef-56ab-9cf4-c2f213b2bcca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/