frac{2}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 2=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186678692 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1acdab75-b682-5d89-ba17-ef276f394c2f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678615} {:answer/id #uuid "2f6f1436-fadd-5101-aa8b-be44f17bc594" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{8 x}{3} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678628} {:answer/id #uuid "403d2dc3-963b-5194-a2fb-f787dfc3d9fc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678638} {:answer/id #uuid "828afea6-4215-56e4-94ab-9886a6888c55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678684} {:answer/id #uuid "e79c0c7a-5a34-5d70-8576-7d4bdc57b10f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678743}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e79c0c7a-5a34-5d70-8576-7d4bdc57b10f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678743} :answer-field/id #uuid "615685fd-3c77-5732-ab7a-0dd80584e0da" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678670}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "95398754-8d8a-50d4-bfa4-4cf30d049a32" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{4 x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{4}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - 16 x^{2}}=3\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{4 x}{3})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{3}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{4}{3}\\cdot \\frac{3}{4}=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186678693 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "14d7fe58-cb78-5376-b60d-1710c7c0662a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678609} {:answer/id #uuid "547ac542-6f7d-5596-9293-e57946cc34eb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answ