\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed integral is\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186678764 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "885e4496-b864-582d-8ccb-3dac8e719b70" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678686} {:answer/id #uuid "9f99ecbe-eb5c-5e2d-be3e-2096e603573e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678694} {:answer/id #uuid "bd8af89a-b0b5-5864-a25f-58ec78587fb0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678711} {:answer/id #uuid "ec9975a3-6238-5b85-a2d3-e2d78704d3ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678750} {:answer/id #uuid "fd6c2c84-bed1-5d08-abac-17fbbc982558" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678765}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fd6c2c84-bed1-5d08-abac-17fbbc982558" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678765} :answer-field/id #uuid "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678757}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "fc157b00-d7e7-54d0-826d-effc6b6af186" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{3 x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{3}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - 9 x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{3 x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{1}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186679722 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0b45d82d-d26e-5c68-a136-f5686a3380de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679729} {:answer/id #uuid "1268b773-686b-5e87-a8e0-5956661826c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679736} {:answer/id #uuid "153207b8-967f-5f59-bd12-ae5e22b97cd9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679740} {:answer/id #uuid "97886b89-c7e2