:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186679835 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "069833a3-d3b4-5a2c-8c1d-5e4831d5dd92" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679726} {:answer/id #uuid "37443c11-d637-5757-ac8e-24ae357fcae1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679758} {:answer/id #uuid "40a499b3-4946-5824-9e23-c62411759546" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679766} {:answer/id #uuid "653e40a6-e01b-596d-933b-71404bcfb65c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679788} {:answer/id #uuid "6672914f-bf49-5394-b4b7-0024279d68b4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679789}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6672914f-bf49-5394-b4b7-0024279d68b4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679789} :answer-field/id #uuid "78a2c40b-4f5e-5b3d-a066-8a1ca5b2c47a" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679803}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "ac7ccb86-e562-5c18-93ff-df4783c50a60" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqr